  <content>
  <note class="self-check" id="sect-00001"><para id="para-00001">A baseball is thrown into the air. The following data set shows the height in feet, \(y\), of the baseball corresponding to the number of seconds passed, \(x\).</para>
<iframe src="../../media/desmos/6fefd9d694ef87eabb8465c897c5d6d2b4cbab94.html" width="500" height="400"/><para id="para-00002">Approximately how long will it be before the baseball hits the ground?</para></section>
</content>
